preConditionHook:
// The trade came within toleranceDollars of its profit target, the limit never
// filled, and the market has now closed beyond the prior bar's extreme: give up on
// the target and leave on the structure break.
// MaxPositionProfit is the INTRABAR running peak of the favourable extreme
// (VERIFIED), net of the entry side's costs -- which is exactly the 'came
// within a tick of the target' reading, since the limit would have filled on
// that extreme. It must not be hand-rolled: it starts at 0 per position and a
// reversal opens a new position without passing through flat.
// Both thresholds are DOLLARS, matching the accessor's units; toleranceDollars
// defaults to one Emini tick.
